  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Who has scored the most goals in a single year?",
      "scene": {
        "hook": true,
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "messi_2012",
            "big": "?",
            "bigSize": 420,
            "bigY": 1300,
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Most people would say Lionel Messi. In 2012, he scored ninety-one.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "portrait",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "portrait",
            "person": {
              "image": "messi"
            },
            "name": "LIONEL MESSI",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "from": 0,
            "to": 91,
            "word": "GOALS IN 2012",
            "size": 420,
            "w": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Seventy-nine for Barcelona. Twelve for Argentina.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "grid",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "grid",
            "legend": true,
            "groups": [
              {
                "n": 79,
                "col": "#a50044",
                "label": "BARCELONA"
              },
              {
                "n": 12,
                "col": "#75aadb",
                "label": "ARGENTINA"
              }
            ],
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "On the ninth of December, at Real Betis, he scored number eighty-six.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "counter",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "prop": "calendar",
            "top": "DECEMBER",
            "from": 1,
            "to": 9,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "messi_betis",
            "label": "REAL BETIS 1-2 BARCELONA",
            "w": 6
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "messi_betis",
            "big": "86",
            "bigSize": 420,
            "bigY": 1250,
            "tr": "cut",
            "w": 11
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That broke a record that had stood for forty years. Gerd Müller's eighty-five, in 1972.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "purple",
        "type": "years",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "years",
            "items": [
              {
                "year": "1972",
                "top": "RECORD",
                "label": "85 goals",
                "cross": true
              },
              {
                "year": "2012",
                "top": "NEW",
                "label": "86 and counting",
                "tick": true,
                "head": "#1ea85a"
              }
            ],
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "portrait",
            "person": {
              "image": "muller"
            },
            "name": "GERD MÜLLER",
            "bg": "red",
            "w": 10
          },
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "from": 0,
            "to": 85,
            "word": "GOALS IN 1972",
            "size": 420,
            "bg": "red",
            "w": 12
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Seventy-two for Bayern Munich, thirteen for West Germany.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "red",
        "type": "statbars",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statbars",
            "person": {
              "image": "muller"
            },
            "stats": [
              {
                "v": 72,
                "label": "BAYERN MUNICH",
                "col": "#dc052d"
              },
              {
                "v": 13,
                "label": "WEST GERMANY",
                "col": "#111"
              }
            ],
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Messi's last goal came at Valladolid, three days before Christmas. Ninety-one.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "counter",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "prop": "calendar",
            "top": "DECEMBER",
            "from": 9,
            "to": 22,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "grid",
            "instant": true,
            "legend": true,
            "groups": [
              {
                "n": 79,
                "col": "#a50044",
                "label": "BARCELONA"
              },
              {
                "n": 12,
                "col": "#75aadb",
                "label": "ARGENTINA"
              }
            ],
            "w": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Guinness made it the official world record.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "guinness_cert",
            "stamp": "WORLD RECORD",
            "stampY": 1350,
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But in Zambia, they tell a very different story.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "green",
        "type": "flag",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "flag",
            "flag": {
              "base": "#198a00",
              "emblem": "#ef7d00",
              "stripes": [
                {
                  "x0": 0.62,
                  "x1": 0.75,
                  "col": "#de2010",
                  "top": 0.38
                },
                {
                  "x0": 0.75,
                  "x1": 0.875,
                  "col": "#111111",
                  "top": 0.38
                },
                {
                  "x0": 0.875,
                  "x1": 1.0,
                  "col": "#ef7d00",
                  "top": 0.38
                }
              ]
            },
            "label": "ZAMBIA",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "zambia_1972",
            "label": "ZAMBIA · 1972",
            "w": 7
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Godfrey Chitalu. A striker for Kabwe Warriors, and for Zambia.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "green",
        "type": "portrait",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "portrait",
            "person": {
              "color": "#1b1416",
              "hair": "#0e0a0b",
              "suit": false,
              "rim": "rgba(255,216,74,.7)"
            },
            "name": "GODFREY CHITALU",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "KABWE WARRIORS|+ ZAMBIA",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 140,
            "w": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Zambian researchers say that in 1972, the same year as Müller, he scored a hundred and seven.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "green",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "chitalu_goal",
            "label": "THE SAME YEAR AS MÜLLER",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "from": 0,
            "to": 107,
            "word": "GOALS IN 1972",
            "size": 420,
            "w": 14
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Forty-nine in the league. Fifty-eight in cups and for his country.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "grid",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "grid",
            "legend": true,
            "cols": 12,
            "groups": [
              {
                "n": 49,
                "col": "#198a00",
                "label": "LEAGUE"
              },
              {
                "n": 58,
                "col": "#ef7d00",
                "label": "CUPS + ZAMBIA"
              }
            ],
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So why isn't that the record? FIFA said it couldn't check it.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "purple",
        "type": "versus",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "versus",
            "left": {
              "image": "messi"
            },
            "leftNum": "91",
            "leftName": "MESSI",
            "right": {
              "color": "#1b1416",
              "hair": "#0e0a0b",
              "suit": false,
              "rim": "rgba(255,216,74,.7)"
            },
            "rightNum": "107",
            "rightName": "CHITALU",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "old_records",
            "stamp": "UNVERIFIED",
            "stampY": 1350,
            "w": 6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A lot of the match reports from back then are patchy, or lost.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "orange",
        "type": "ledger",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "ledger",
            "title": "1972",
            "title2": "RESULTS",
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And Chitalu can't tell his side. He died in 1993, coaching Zambia, when the team's plane crashed off Gabon.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "portrait",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "portrait",
            "person": {
              "color": "#1b1416",
              "hair": "#0e0a0b",
              "suit": false,
              "rim": "rgba(255,216,74,.7)"
            },
            "name": "GODFREY CHITALU",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "memorial",
            "label": "27 APRIL 1993",
            "w": 7
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So who really holds the record? Ninety-one, or a hundred and seven?",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "purple",
        "type": "versus",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "versus",
            "left": {
              "image": "messi"
            },
            "leftNum": "91",
            "leftName": "MESSI · 2012",
            "right": {
              "color": "#1b1416",
              "hair": "#0e0a0b",
              "suit": false,
              "rim": "rgba(255,216,74,.7)"
            },
            "rightNum": "107",
            "rightName": "CHITALU · 1972",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "91|OR|107?",
            "hi": 2,
            "size": 220,
            "w": 9
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}